OL,3,GNEWSALife of trans trailblazer
OL,4,Acelebrated in show of her personal
OL,5,Apossessions
OL,6,
OL,7,FA new collection featuring a range of
OL,8,Feveryday belongings of the "pioneering"
OL,9,Ftransgender activist April Ashley aims
OL,10,Fto tell the "lesser known stories" of
OL,11,Fher life, its curator has said.
OL,13,FOnly the second Briton to undergo
OL,14,Fmale-to-female gender reassignment
OL,15,Fsurgery in 1960, Ashley, born in the
OL,16,FNorris Green area of Liverpool in 1935,
OL,17,Fwas well known as a Vogue model and
OL,18,Factress.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
