OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSALife of trans trailblazer
OL,4,Acelebrated in show of her personal
OL,5,Apossessions
OL,6,
OL,7,FSome 47 of her possessions have gone on
OL,8,Fdisplay at Liverpool Museum, from
OL,9,Fglamorous jewellery, keepsakes she
OL,10,Facquired while living in Wales and
OL,11,Fsouvenirs from her time in San Diego,
OL,12,FCalifornia.
OL,14,FLead curator Kay Jones said it was
OL,15,F"really nice to think about the
OL,16,Fdifferent facets of someone and to see
OL,17,Fthem as a more rounded individual".
